From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LuneOS / webOS Ports <team@webos-ports.org>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ums_connector: do not link the impl library to itself

  CMake Error at src/ums_connector/CMakeLists.txt:30 (add_library):
    Target "ums_connector_impl" links to itself.

target_link_libraries() for ums_connector_impl lists ums_connector_impl among
its own dependencies. Older CMake quietly dropped the self-reference; CMake 4
rejects it outright.

Only this first block is wrong. The two later references - from ums_connector
and ums_connector_wrapper - are other targets legitimately linking against the
impl library and are left alone.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 src/ums_connector/CMakeLists.txt | 3 +--
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/ums_connector/CMakeLists.txt b/src/ums_connector/CMakeLists.txt
index c49e98a..803b14c 100644
--- a/src/ums_connector/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/src/ums_connector/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -34,8 +34,7 @@ target_link_libraries(${LIB_IMPL_NAME}
                       ${GLIB2_LDFLAGS}
                       ${LUNASERVICE_LDFLAGS}
                       ${LIBPBNJSON_LDFLAGS}
-                      ${PMLOGLIB_LDFLAGS}
-                      ums_connector_impl)
+                      ${PMLOGLIB_LDFLAGS})
 webos_build_library(NAME ${LIB_IMPL_NAME})
 
 # Interface library
